WEBVTT

00:06:30.156 --> 00:06:32.716
AF: Well, I certainly continue
to take precautions.

00:06:32.756 --> 00:06:36.316
And I think it's important
that you ask me personally that question,

00:06:36.356 --> 00:06:40.836
because people have different levels
of risk of severity of disease.

00:06:41.356 --> 00:06:44.876
I am a person who is relatively healthy,

00:06:44.876 --> 00:06:46.636
but I'm at an elderly age.

00:06:46.636 --> 00:06:47.836
I'm 81 years old.

00:06:47.836 --> 00:06:50.556
I'm going to be 82 in December.

00:06:50.556 --> 00:06:54.596
So I, statistically,
would have more of a risk.

00:06:54.636 --> 00:06:56.596
So the precautions I take,

00:06:56.636 --> 00:07:00.556
I stay up to date
on my vaccinations, number one.